---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About Matthew Mauro, PMHNP-BC | Mind Menders Psychiatric Care"
  description="Learn about Matthew Mauro, PMHNP-BC — board-certified Psychiatric Mental Health Nurse Practitioner providing compassionate psychiatric care for all ages in Towson, MD."
  activeNav="about"
>
<!-- Page Hero -->
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &rsaquo; <span>About</span></nav>
    <span class="eyebrow-white">About</span>
    <h1>Matthew Mauro, PMHNP-BC</h1>
    <p>Board-certified Psychiatric Mental Health Nurse Practitioner delivering compassionate, evidence-based psychiatric care for children, adolescents, and adults in Towson, MD.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Main Bio -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="two-col-narrow">
      <div>
        <div class="about-card" style="position:relative">
          <div class="about-avatar">&#129657;</div>
          <div class="about-name">Matthew Mauro</div>
          <div class="about-credential">PMHNP-BC</div>
          <p style="font-size:.875rem;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:var(--sp-6)">Psychiatric Mental Health Nurse Practitioner, Board Certified</p>
          <div class="about-cred-list">
            <div class="about-cred"><span class="about-cred-icon">&#127979;</span> Board Certified PMHNP-BC</div>
            <div class="about-cred"><span class="about-cred-icon">&#128100;</span> Children, Teens &amp; Adults</div>
            <div class="about-cred"><span class="about-cred-icon">&#127968;</span> Towson, MD + Telehealth Statewide</div>
            <div class="about-cred"><span class="about-cred-icon">&#128138;</span> Medication Management</div>
            <div class="about-cred"><span class="about-cred-icon">&#128172;</span> Talk Therapy &amp; CBT</div>
            <div class="about-cred"><span class="about-cred-icon">&#128149;</span> Trauma-Informed Care</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Background</span>
        <h2>A Provider Who Truly Listens</h2>
        <p>Matthew Mauro is a dedicated board-certified Psychiatric Mental Health Nurse Practitioner (PMHNP-BC) with extensive clinical experience across a wide range of psychiatric settings. His career has been built on one foundational belief: that every patient deserves a thorough evaluation, a personalized treatment plan, and a provider who genuinely cares.</p>
        <p>At Mind Menders Psychiatric Care, Matthew combines deep clinical expertise with evidence-based approaches &mdash; medication management, talk therapy, cognitive behavioral therapy (CBT), and trauma-informed care &mdash; to deliver holistic, effective treatment for patients across the lifespan.</p>
        <p>He has a particular passion for working with individuals with ADHD and autism spectrum disorder, and has developed significant expertise in these areas over the course of his career. His approach is collaborative: he works alongside patients and families to build treatment plans that reflect not just clinical best practices, but each person&rsquo;s individual goals, values, and circumstances.</p>
        <p>Whether you&rsquo;re seeking help for a child, a teenager, or yourself, you&rsquo;ll find in Matthew a provider who takes the time to truly understand your situation &mdash; and who is committed to your long-term well-being.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Schedule an Appointment &#8594;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Credentials -->
<section class="section section-light">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header center">
      <span class="eyebrow">Credentials &amp; Expertise</span>
      <h2>Training &amp; Specializations</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="services-grid">
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon-wrap">&#127979;</div>
        <h3>Board Certification</h3>
        <p>Certified by the American Nurses Credentialing Center (ANCC) as a Psychiatric Mental Health Nurse Practitioner (PMHNP-BC), the gold standard in advanced psychiatric nursing practice.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon-wrap">&#128100;</div>
        <h3>Lifespan Expertise</h3>
        <p>Specialized training and clinical experience treating patients from early childhood through adulthood. Matthew understands the developmental nuances of psychiatric care at every stage of life.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon-wrap">&#129504;</div>
        <h3>ADHD &amp; Neurodevelopment</h3>
        <p>Extensive experience evaluating and managing ADHD and neurodevelopmental conditions. Skilled in comprehensive diagnostic workups and evidence-based treatment strategies for all ages.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon-wrap">&#129490;</div>
        <h3>Autism Spectrum</h3>
        <p>Deep expertise in psychiatric care for individuals with autism &mdash; addressing co-occurring mental health conditions, behavioral challenges, and family support with knowledge and compassion.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon-wrap">&#128149;</div>
        <h3>Trauma-Informed Practice</h3>
        <p>Trained in trauma-informed care principles. Every clinical interaction prioritizes safety, trustworthiness, and patient autonomy &mdash; essential foundations for effective psychiatric treatment.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon-wrap">&#128138;</div>
        <h3>Psychopharmacology</h3>
        <p>Advanced knowledge of psychiatric medications &mdash; careful prescribing, thorough monitoring, and ongoing dose optimization to achieve the best possible outcomes with the fewest side effects.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Philosophy -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:840px">
    <div class="section-header center">
      <span class="eyebrow">Philosophy of Care</span>
      <h2>What You Can Expect</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="treatment-list">
      <div class="treatment-item">
        <div class="treatment-icon">&#128065;</div>
        <div>
          <h4>Thorough Evaluation</h4>
          <p>Your first appointment isn&rsquo;t a 15-minute intake. Matthew takes the time to understand your complete history, current symptoms, and life context before recommending any treatment.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="treatment-item">
        <div class="treatment-icon">&#127919;</div>
        <div>
          <h4>Individualized Treatment Plans</h4>
          <p>No two patients are alike. Your treatment plan is built around your specific diagnosis, history, preferences, and goals &mdash; not a one-size-fits-all protocol.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="treatment-item">
        <div class="treatment-icon">&#128172;</div>
        <div>
          <h4>Open, Honest Communication</h4>
          <p>Matthew explains diagnoses, treatment options, and medications in plain language. You&rsquo;ll always understand why a recommendation is being made and what to expect.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="treatment-item">
        <div class="treatment-icon">&#128200;</div>
        <div>
          <h4>Ongoing Monitoring &amp; Adjustment</h4>
          <p>Psychiatric care is a process. Follow-up appointments ensure treatment is working, medication dosages are appropriate, and the plan evolves as your needs change.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="cta-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Ready to Get Started?</h2>
    <p>New patients are welcome. Call or reach out to schedule your first appointment.</p>
    <div class="cta-phone"><a href="tel:4437987707">(443) 798-7707</a></div>
    <div class="cta-actions">
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-white btn-lg">Contact Us</a>
      <a href="/services" class="btn btn-outline-white btn-lg">View Services</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
